From 83d599f08df598770926afcccfd860f979418678 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1vivy <1vivy@tutanota.com>
Date: Mon, 6 Jul 2026 08:04:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Sandbox: add exported vault import vector + Vault-tab
 deep-link

Expose an import path into the encrypted vault for trusted callers:
- VaultFileProvider.call() gains importFile (routes to
  FileVaultManager.importFile) and isConfigured, caller-gated to
  system/shell/root/self and the com.oplus.encryption SafeBox shim.
- MainActivity reads a new intent extra
  (com.android.axion.sandbox.extra.OPEN_TAB) to open straight on a tab,
  so callers can deep-link to the Vault tab.

Lets the OnePlus gallery's "Move to Private Safe" import media into the
Sandbox vault and open it on the Vault tab.
